# PRIVATE (미방송분): the Overdubbed Thing. A clump of broadcast caption fragments, never a person.
# idle_0..2 jitter loop, lunge (JS1/JS8), shed (a fragment falls when a knot is untied),
# knot_4 / knot_7 (smaller as the lies come apart), sit (5-07, before the small table), off (last).
# Glyphs spell nothing; real words are drawn at runtime. Use with linear.pal.
@palette ../palette/linear.pal
@size 48 64
@output ../characters/mbs_overdub.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_overdub_x4.png 4
@columns 5

@frame idle_0
